  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Varies <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Bladed Melee Weapons which do not already ignore all of a target’s SP under a certain threshold</p>\n<p><em>Kendachi’s newest monoblades are so thin they can even be applied to pre-existing models with relatively little effort (but lots of euro).</em></p>\n<p>Cannot be installed into Poor Quality Weapons. Only one Monoblade Rebuild may be installed. Damage dealt by the weapon now ignores the target’s armor entirely if it is below an SP threshold determined by the type of installed Monoblade Rebuild. Armor with a higher SP is still interacted with as normal. Available Monoblade Rebuilds include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Basic:</strong> 1,000eb (V. Expensive) — Ignores armor lower than SP 7.</li>\n<li><strong>Tuned:</strong> 3,000eb (Luxury) — Ignores armor lower than SP 11.</li>\n<li><strong>Perfected:</strong> 7,500eb (S. Luxury) — Ignores armor lower than SP 13.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Miscellaneous &amp; Accessories).</em></p>"
